# kdos-sources-index 2
# ports/sources.idx — where the KDOS source archive keeps each file.
#
#   <sha256> <tag> <asset> <port>/<file> [parts=<N>:<h1>,<h2>,…,<hN>]
#
# <tag> is the GitHub release on kunaldawn/kdos that holds the file: src-<shelf>
# for the shelf of the first port that names it, or src-attic for a file only
# old history names. <asset> is the name GitHub stored, which is what the
# download URL uses; the file's own name is <port>/<file>. A file larger than
# 1900 MiB is stored as <asset>.part01 … <asset>.partNN, whose SHA-256s are listed in
# order after parts=. ports/fetch joins them and checks <sha256> over the whole.
# One line per hash, sorted by hash. Written by ports/publish; the only hand edit
# is deleting a line.
